    "SEC (access control, other routes; part of F1, which is scored as SEC-017): the listing (legacy index.php:72-97) and the CSV route (legacy index.php:44-47) served every ticket to clients, contrary to the manifest's visibility rule; the delivery limits both to the client's own tickets in the web layer and keeps the public functions unscoped",
